# Task

`shop.ts` is a shop's stock, orders and automations, written in TypeScript. `REQUEST.md` is
the change to make. Change `shop.ts` so it does what the request asks and everything else
keeps working as before; keep its existing functions' names and parameters unless the
request changes them.

- `./check` type-checks the program (`tsc --strict`).
- `./test` runs `tests.ts` with Node, if you write one (`import ... from "./shop.ts"`).

Finish when the change is done and `./check` passes.
